---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <section class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:items-end">
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-red-accent">MADISON TAYLOR HOBBS</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] sm:text-6xl">AI-assisted CFD meshing for high-fidelity hypersonic simulations.</h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-lg text-base leading-7 text-graphite">
        I am a fourth-year graduate student in the Hypersonics Research Laboratory in MIT’s Department of Aeronautics and Astronautics. Within 16.S893, this project explores AI-assisted CFD mesh generation and mesh qualification: cell skewness, aspect ratio, orthogonality, volume validity, near-wall <code>y+</code>, and grid-convergence analysis for high-fidelity hypersonic simulations.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <a class="border-b border-slate-accent pb-1 text-slate-accent hover:text-red-accent" href="about/">About me</a>
        <a class="border-b border-slate-accent pb-1 text-slate-accent hover:text-red-accent" href="project/">Current project</a>
      </div>
    </div>

